{"seq":2,"slug":"real-time-dashboards","title":"实时数据看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/live-ops/real-time-dashboards","wordCount":1531,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"实时数据看板\">实时数据看板</h1><h2 id=\"看板的本质-缩短从异常到行动的时间\">看板的本质：缩短从异常到行动的时间</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/data-pipeline-architecture\">数据管线</a>把原始事件加工成可查询的数据，<a href=\"ab-testing-experimentation\">A/B 测试</a>把假设变成可验证的实验——实时看板则把这些数据变成<strong>肉眼可感知、异常可触发行动</strong>的&quot;控制面板&quot;。</p>\n<p>看板的核心价值不是&quot;展示数据&quot;，而是<strong>缩短 MTTD（Mean Time to Detect）和 MTTR（Mean Time to Respond）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>无看板</th>\n<th>有看板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>次日凌晨拉报表发现昨天收入暴跌</td>\n<td>秒级发现异常并告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上线后一周才知道留存受损</td>\n<td>上线后 4 小时看到实时 Cohort 偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动结束后复盘才知道奖励发多了</td>\n<td>活动进行中实时监控经济指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>2026 年行业标准</strong>：头部游戏工作室的关键指标延迟 &lt; 30 秒，告警到响应 &lt; 5 分钟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实时数据看板的关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MTTD / MTTR</strong>：从异常发生到被发现的时间（Detect）、从发现到恢复的时间（Respond）——看板直接优化这两个延迟</li>\n<li><strong>基线对比（Baseline Comparison）</strong>：孤立数值无意义，只有对比同比/环比/预测基线才能判断&quot;正常 vs 异常&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>异常检测（Anomaly Detection）</strong>：用统计方法自动识别偏离正常范围的指标值</li>\n<li><strong>告警分级（Alert Severity）</strong>：Critical/Warning/Info 分层避免告警疲劳</li>\n<li><strong>下钻（Drill-down）</strong>：从概览 KPI 逐层深入到维度拆解、原始事件的交互能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"看板分层体系\">看板分层体系</h2><p>不同角色需要不同层级的信息密度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    L1[L1 高管看板&lt;br/&gt;3-5 个核心 KPI&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:日] --&gt; L2[L2 运营看板&lt;br/&gt;20-30 个指标&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:小时]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L3[L3 分析师看板&lt;br/&gt;50+ 可下钻指标&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:分钟]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L4[L4 工程看板&lt;br/&gt;系统级监控&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:秒级]\">flowchart TB\n    L1[L1 高管看板&lt;br/&gt;3-5 个核心 KPI&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:日] --&gt; L2[L2 运营看板&lt;br/&gt;20-30 个指标&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:小时]\n    L2 --&gt; L3[L3 分析师看板&lt;br/&gt;50+ 可下钻指标&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:分钟]\n    L3 --&gt; L4[L4 工程看板&lt;br/&gt;系统级监控&lt;br/&gt;更新频率:秒级]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>受众</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>数据延迟</th>\n<th>交互方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 Executive</td>\n<td>CEO/制作人</td>\n<td>Revenue, MAU, LTV, D30 Ret</td>\n<td>T+1 天</td>\n<td>只读大屏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 Operations</td>\n<td>运营总监</td>\n<td>DAU, ARPDAU, CVR, 活动 ROI</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>筛选+对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 Analyst</td>\n<td>数据分析师</td>\n<td>全量指标 + 自定义分群</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>下钻+SQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 Engineering</td>\n<td>SRE/后端</td>\n<td>QPS, 延迟, 错误率, 队列深度</td>\n<td>10 秒</td>\n<td>告警+自动化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标监控设计\">指标监控设计</h2><h3 id=\"核心指标面板\">核心指标面板</h3><p>游戏实时看板的&quot;黄金七指标&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 实时核心指标聚合（5 分钟窗口）&#10;SELECT&#10;  window_start,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN event = &#39;session_start&#39; THEN player_id END) AS realtime_dau,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN event = &#39;purchase_complete&#39; THEN player_id END) AS paying_users,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN event = &#39;purchase_complete&#39; THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS revenue,&#10;  COUNT(CASE WHEN event = &#39;session_start&#39; THEN 1 END) AS sessions,&#10;  AVG(CASE WHEN event = &#39;session_end&#39; THEN session_duration_sec END) AS avg_session_sec,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN event = &#39;first_login&#39; THEN player_id END) AS new_users,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN event = &#39;ad_impression&#39; THEN ad_revenue ELSE 0 END) AS ad_revenue&#10;FROM events_stream&#10;WHERE event_timestamp &gt;= NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;5 minutes&#39;&#10;GROUP BY TUMBLE(event_timestamp, INTERVAL &#39;5 minutes&#39;) AS window_start;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实时核心指标聚合（5 分钟窗口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'session_start'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> realtime_dau,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'purchase_complete'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paying_users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'purchase_complete'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'session_start'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sessions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'session_end'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_duration_sec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_session_sec,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'first_login'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ad_impression'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ad_revenue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ad_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events_stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5 minutes'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TUMBLE(event_timestamp, INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5 minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_start;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"同比-环比基线\">同比/环比基线</h3><p>孤立的实时数值没有意义——需要基线对比才能判断&quot;正常还是异常&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时刻同比</td>\n<td>上周同一时刻的值</td>\n<td>排除周内波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日内进度</td>\n<td>当前累计 / 昨日同时段累计</td>\n<td>判断日终是否达标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7 日滚动均值</td>\n<td>过去 7 天同一小时的均值</td>\n<td>稳健基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测值</td>\n<td>时序模型外推的预期值</td>\n<td>异常检测触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compute_baseline_comparison(current_value, metric_name, timestamp):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算多维度基线对比&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    same_hour_last_week = get_metric(&#10;        metric_name,&#10;        timestamp - timedelta(days=7),&#10;        window=&#39;1h&#39;&#10;    )&#10;    rolling_7d_avg = get_rolling_average(&#10;        metric_name,&#10;        timestamp,&#10;        lookback_days=7,&#10;        same_hour=True&#10;    )&#10;    daily_progress = get_cumulative_today(metric_name, timestamp)&#10;    yesterday_same_time = get_cumulative_yesterday(metric_name, timestamp)&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;current&#39;: current_value,&#10;        &#39;wow_change&#39;: (current_value - same_hour_last_week) / same_hour_last_week,&#10;        &#39;vs_7d_avg&#39;: (current_value - rolling_7d_avg) / rolling_7d_avg,&#10;        &#39;daily_pacing&#39;: daily_progress / yesterday_same_time if yesterday_same_time &gt; 0 else None,&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_baseline_comparison</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current_value, metric_name, timestamp):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"计算多维度基线对比\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    same_hour_last_week </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_metric(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        metric_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        window</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1h'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rolling_7d_avg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_rolling_average(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        metric_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        timestamp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        lookback_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        same_hour</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5