ke'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'metric'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'crash_rate_5min'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'condition'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'value > 0.02'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'severity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cooldown_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'notification'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pagerduty'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack_oncall'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'description'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5 分钟崩溃率超过 2%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'payment_failure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'metric'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment_success_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'condition'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'value &#x3C; 0.90'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'severity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cooldown_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'notification'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pagerduty'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'description'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付成功率低于 90%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"告警疲劳的治理\">告警疲劳的治理</h3><p>告警过多导致团队&quot;免疫&quot;（Alert Fatigue）是实时监控的头号问题。应对策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分级</strong>：Critical（立即响应）→ Warning（30分钟内看）→ Info（日报汇总）</li>\n<li><strong>降噪</strong>：合并相关告警、去抖（debounce）、使用 cooldown</li>\n<li><strong>自愈</strong>：已知的瞬时问题（如 CDN 切换）配自动恢复，不出告警</li>\n<li><strong>SLO 导向</strong>：只对影响 SLO 的指标发 Critical 告警</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"可视化最佳实践\">可视化最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"图表选型\">图表选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>推荐图表</th>\n<th>反模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序趋势</td>\n<td>折线图 + 基线带</td>\n<td>饼图看趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时分布</td>\n<td>直方图/热力图</td>\n<td>表格展示分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级下钻</td>\n<td>Treemap/旭日图</td>\n<td>层级太深的饼图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理分布</td>\n<td>Choropleth 地图</td>\n<td>表格列国家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常高亮</td>\n<td>折线 + 阴影区间</td>\n<td>无基线的折线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏斗</td>\n<td>漏斗图/桑基图</td>\n<td>堆叠柱状图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"交互设计原则\">交互设计原则</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>先概览后细节（Overview → Detail）</strong>：首屏只放 KPI 大数字，下钻到具体维度</li>\n<li><strong>对比而非孤立</strong>：任何数值旁边都要有基线或对比值</li>\n<li><strong>异常先行</strong>：红/黄/绿 信号灯让异常一眼可见</li>\n<li><strong>可操作</strong>：每个告警旁边直接链接到排查 Runbook</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"技术架构\">技术架构</h2><h3 id=\"实时看板数据流\">实时看板数据流</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    EVT[事件流&lt;br/&gt;Kafka] --&gt; FLINK[Flink&lt;br/&gt;实时聚合]&#10;    FLINK --&gt; CH[ClickHouse&lt;br/&gt;实时 OLAP]&#10;    FLINK --&gt; REDIS[Redis&lt;br/&gt;最新快照]&#10;    CH --&gt; GRAFANA[Grafana&lt;br/&gt;看板渲染]&#10;    REDIS --&gt; GRAFANA&#10;    GRAFANA --&gt; ALERT[AlertManager&lt;br/&gt;告警路由]&#10;    ALERT --&gt; SLACK[Slack/PagerDuty]\">flowchart LR\n    EVT[事件流&lt;br/&gt;Kafka] --&gt; FLINK[Flink&lt;br/&gt;实时聚合]\n    FLINK --&gt; CH[ClickHouse&lt;br/&gt;实时 OLAP]\n    FLINK --&gt; REDIS[Redis&lt;br/&gt;最新快照]\n    CH --&gt; GRAFANA[Grafana&lt;br/&gt;看板渲染]\n    REDIS --&gt; GRAFANA\n    GRAFANA --&gt; ALERT[AlertManager&lt;br/&gt;告警路由]\n    ALERT --&gt; SLACK[Slack/PagerDuty]</pre><h3 id=\"技术选型对比\">技术选型对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>备选</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时聚合</td>\n<td>Apache Flink</td>\n<td>Spark Structured Streaming</td>\n<td>窗口延迟 &lt; 5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OLAP 存储</td>\n<td>ClickHouse</td>\n<td>Apache Druid, StarRocks</td>\n<td>查询 P99 &lt; 500ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存层</td>\n<td>Redis Cluster</td>\n<td>Memcached</td>\n<td>读延迟 &lt; 1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>Grafana</td>\n<td>Superset, Metabase</td>\n<td>渲染 &lt; 2s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警</td>\n<td>Alertmanager + PagerDuty</td>\n<td>OpsGenie</td>\n<td>触发到通知 &lt; 30s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"clickhouse-实时查询示例\">ClickHouse 实时查询示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 实时 DAU 趋势（5 分钟粒度）&#10;SELECT&#10;  toStartOfFiveMinutes(event_time) AS ts,&#10;  uniqExact(player_id) AS dau_5min,&#10;  uniqExactIf(player_id, event_type = &#39;purchase_complete&#39;) AS payers_5min,&#10;  sumIf(revenue_usd, event_type = &#39;purchase_complete&#39;) AS revenue_5min&#10;FROM game_events_realtime&#10;WHERE event_time &gt;= now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR&#10;GROUP BY ts&#10;ORDER BY ts;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实时 DAU 趋势（5 分钟粒度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  toStartOfFiveMinutes(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uniqExact(player_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dau_5min,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uniqExactIf(player_id, event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'purchase_complete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payers_5min,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sumIf(revenue_usd, event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'purchase_complete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue_5min</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> game_events_realtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HOUR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"活动监控看板\">活动监控看板</h2><p>大型运营活动（如赛季开启、跨服战、限时折扣）需要专属看板：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控维度</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>告警条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参与度</td>\n<td>活动参与率、DAU 提升倍数</td>\n<td>参与率 &lt; 预期 50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济</td>\n<td>奖励发放量、资源消耗</td>\n<td>发放量超预算 120%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术</td>\n<td>匹配延迟、服务器负载</td>\n<td>匹配等待 &gt; 60s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付费</td>\n<td>活动商品 CVR、活动收入</td>\n<td>低于同类活动基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体验</td>\n<td>客诉量、差评突增</td>\n<td>客诉环比 +200%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与其他模块的关系\">与其他模块的关系</h2><ul>\n<li>看板的指标定义来源于<a href=\"../foundations/game-metrics-taxonomy\">指标体系</a></li>\n<li>实时数据依赖<a href=\"../foundations/data-pipeline-architecture\">数据管线</a>的流处理层</li>\n<li>异常检测结果可触发<a href=\"ab-testing-experimentation\">A/B 测试</a>的紧急熔断</li>\n<li>经济类告警与<a href=\"economy-health-monitoring\">经济健康监控</a>深度集成</li>\n<li>可视化的指标与<a href=\"../../../data-science/anomaly-detection/\">数据科学</a>中的异常检测方法论对齐</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>实时看板是将数据管线的产出转化为可行动决策的最后一环。核心设计原则：分层（不同角色看不同粒度）、对比（任何数值需搭配基线）、异常先行（红黄绿信号灯让偏差一眼可见）、可操作（告警旁直接链接 Runbook）。技术架构以 Flink 实时聚合 + ClickHouse OLAP + Grafana 渲染为典型选型，端到端延迟控制在 30 秒内。告警治理是长期运营的关键——分级、降噪、自愈、SLO 导向，避免团队对告警&quot;免疫&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实时数据看板","id":"实时数据看板"},{"level":2,"text":"看板的本质：缩短从异常到行动的时间","id":"看板的本质-缩短从异常到行动的时间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"看板分层体系","id":"看板分层体系"},{"level":2,"text":"指标监控设计","id":"指标监控设计"},{"level":3,"text":"核心指标面板","id":"核心指标面板"},{"level":3,"text":"同比/环比基线","id":"同比-环比基线"},{"level":2,"text":"异常检测","id":"异常检测"},{"level":3,"text":"统计方法选型","id":"统计方法选型"},{"level":3,"text":"告警规则设计","id":"告警规则设计"},{"level":3,"text":"告警疲劳的治理","id":"告警疲劳的治理"},{"level":2,"text":"可视化最佳实践","id":"可视化最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"图表选型","id":"图表选型"},{"level":3,"text":"交互设计原则","id":"交互设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"技术架构","id":"技术架构"},{"level":3,"text":"实时看板数据流","id":"实时看板数据流"},{"level":3,"text":"技术选型对比","id":"技术选型对比"},{"level":3,"text":"ClickHouse 实时查询示例","id":"clickhouse-实时查询示例"},{"level":2,"text":"活动监控看板","id":"活动监控看板"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他模块的关系","id":"与其他模块的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"A/B 测试与实验平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/live-ops/ab-testing-experimentation"},"next":{"title":"游戏经济健康监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/live-ops/economy-health-monitoring"}}